/geodata/
# Terraform: provider downloads, local state and saved plans. .terraform.lock.hcl is committed.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
